---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="For schools · Mental Note" active="for-schools">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">For schools</div>
  <h1>Bring us to your school.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Assemblies, health classes, business classes, and student conferences. Students hear it differently from people their own age.</p>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:48px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="eyebrow">Our talks</div>
  <h2>Two speakers, two different talks.</h2>
  <div class="talks">
    <div class="talk paper lit tape dk"><span class="who">Co-founder 1</span><h3>The story</h3><p>A first-person account of what the last few years actually looked like, and what helped. Built for assemblies and health classes.</p><i>35–45 min · Q&amp;A included</i></div>
    <div class="talk paper lit tape dk"><span class="who">Co-founder 2</span><h3>Building it</h3><p>What teenagers actually need from digital tools, and what it takes to start a nonprofit in high school. Built for business and CS classes.</p><i>35–45 min · Q&amp;A included</i></div>
    <div class="talk paper lit tape dk"><span class="who">Both</span><h3>Story and substance</h3><p>The paired version — lived experience alongside what the research says. Our strongest format for a full assembly.</p><i>50–60 min</i></div>
  </div>
  <p class="plain">Mental Note is peer-led. We're students, not clinicians, and we don't provide counseling or crisis services. Every talk points students toward 988 and Crisis Text Line, and we'll coordinate with your counseling staff before we speak.</p>
</div></div>

<div class="schools"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="schgrid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Booking</div>
      <h2>What it costs.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Pricing is being finalised. Tell us the format, the group size, and your date, and we'll come back with a quote.</p>
      <a class="cta" href="#">Request a booking →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="quote paper lit tape dk">
      <span class="stat dk">No talks booked yet</span>
      We'll put a real quote here after our first three. Not a made-up one.
      <i>Honest placeholder</i>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
